          "truth": "At about 20:20 you followed him into the study and shouted at him over the directorship. Afterwards you sat alone in the dining room, wrote him a furious letter saying you would make him regret it, tore it up and threw it in the grate. You meant you would resign and take your best customers to a rival line."
        },
