      "alibi_verification": {
        "status": "confirmed",
        "evidence_ids": [],
        "clue_ids": ["vance-clara-alibi"],
        "note": "Leonard Vance confirms Clara sat at the cribbage table in the drawing room from 20:55 until 21:50, the whole time the study stood empty and the glass was poisoned. Her quarrel and her torn letter are real, but they happened before 20:55, when Vance has Edmund's glass still clean."
