        {
          "clue_id": "vance-green-ledger",
          "text": "Admits the green ledger is a private account Victor kept for him: money of his own that he moved through the club's books as band fees, and the parcel was his to collect after the show. Points out that the parcel was still sitting on the cabinet; had he been in that office during the solo, it would have left with him.",
