          "clue_id": "lena-frank-jumpy",
          "text": "Says Frank Dellow had been jumpy all week, snapping at the staff and watching the office door, and that he and Victor had stopped speaking to each other except in front of customers.",
          "condition": "pressed"
        },
        {
          "clue_id": "lena-drink",
          "text": "Admits the lipstick on the glass is hers: at about 22:40, between sets, she had a rye with Victor in his office and begged him to give Danny more time. He laughed at her, and she walked out leaving him alive and pouring another.",
