          "condition": "shown_evidence:cash-envelope"
        },
        {
          "clue_id": "lena-stranger",
          "text": "Admits she was out in the alley during the solo, and that while she stood in the laundry doorway a man in a dark overcoat, hat brim pulled low, came from the dead end by Victor's back door and hurried past toward River Street at about a quarter to twelve. She turned her face to the wall and never saw his.",
          "condition": "shown_evidence:wet-shoes"
