      "personality": "Eager, jittery and too charming for his own good, a kid who thinks the next hand of cards will fix everything. He worships his sister and resents needing her. He found the body and has not stopped shaking since. He lies quickly and badly, then over-explains.",
      "speech_style": "Fast, nervous Riverside slang: on the level, square, a sap, the dough. Calls the detective 'sir', and sometimes 'Officer' by mistake. Talks with his hands, interrupts himself, and says 'Look, look, look' whenever he is cornered.",
      "alibi": "I was behind the bar the whole drum solo, polishing glasses. Nobody orders during the solo, so I just stood there. Then at five past twelve I went back to see Mr. Kale and found him.",
      "public_facts": [
