          "clue_id": "vance-rotten-paper",
          "text": "Says that when Pike telephoned him last week, the old clerk mentioned he had found 'something rotten in the customs paper' on Ashgrove sailings and meant to see it through, whatever it cost the firm. Pike would not say whose signature was on it.",
          "condition": "pressed"
