        "note": "Vance lied about never being at the pier: the cufflink puts him in the archive and his dossier gives him a motive. But the ferry slip tally book shows his account ticket punched on the 22:40 crossing to Eastbank, with no boat back before 23:50 and an hour by road, and Tommy saw him go out the gate toward the slip at about 22:35. Pike was still alive at 22:45, when he telephoned the Customs House, so Vance's night on the pier ended before the death window opened."
      }
