      "portrait": "woman-hat",
      "color": "#3f5a6e",
      "personality": "Cool, precise and admired: the one inspector the waterfront swears cannot be bought, a reputation she has built brick by brick. Patient and observant, never flustered in public. Underneath runs a cold arithmetic; she weighs every answer for what it will cost before she gives it, and she has nothing but contempt for sloppiness, her own included.",
